<title>UK: ALFRED BERG RATED BEST ON FINNISH ANALYSIS - SURVEY.</title>
<headline>ALFRED BERG RATED BEST ON FINNISH ANALYSIS - SURVEY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the top-rated</p>
<p>analysts by country in the 1997 Reuters European larger</p>
<p>companies survey carried out by Tempest Consultants Ltd.</p>
<p>The analysts were rated by fund managers.</p>
<p>Economic forecasting - Germany Goldman Sachs</p>
<p>Pan European strategy - Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>Austria - SBC Warburg</p>
<p>Belgium/Lux - Dillon Read</p>
<p>Denmark - Alfred Berg</p>
<p>Finland - Alfred Berg</p>
<p>France - Cheuvreux de Virieu-Indosuez</p>
<p>Germany - Deutsche Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p>Italy - Intermobiliare</p>
<p>Netherlands - ABN-AMRO Hoare Govett</p>
<p>Norway - Alfred Berg</p>
<p>Spain - Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>Sweden - Alfred Berg</p>
<p>Switzerland - Pictet &amp; Cie</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
